;PALASM Design Description
; pds2v test: pin assignment errors (check 1) and a register clocked from a
; pin that is not a clock pin.
; EXPECT-EXIT: 1
; EXPECT: error: GNDPIN: pin 6 is a GND pin
; EXPECT: error: VCCPIN: pin 38 is a VCC pin
; EXPECT: error: NOPIN: pin 45 does not exist
; EXPECT: error: pin 2 used twice (A and B)
; EXPECT: error: IN3: pin 26 (I3) is a dedicated input and cannot be driven
; EXPECT: error: X.CLKF = NOTCLK: registers can only be clocked by pins 5, 7, 27, 29
; EXPECT: warning: OK_UNUSED (pin 13) is never used

CHIP     BADPINS  MACH111
PIN  6   GNDPIN
PIN  38  VCCPIN
PIN  45  NOPIN
PIN  2   A
PIN  2   B
PIN  26  IN3   COMBINATORIAL
PIN  40  X     REGISTERED
PIN  4   NOTCLK
PIN  13  OK_UNUSED
PIN  41  USEPINS

EQUATIONS
IN3 = A
X := A * B
X.CLKF = NOTCLK
USEPINS = GNDPIN * VCCPIN * NOPIN
